pecified then. The cancel value"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"matches the fifths value of the canceled key signature (e.g., a cancel of -2 will provide an explicit"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cancellation for changing from B flat major to F major). The optional location attribute indicates where the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cancellation appears relative to the new key signature."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLCancel"}],"title":"MXLCancel"}}}